[00:43.40] Well, I had me a pigeon
[00:47.25] By the name of Fred
[00:51.04] But I done shot him
[00:54.85] In the head
[00:58.57] Had me a railroad
[01:01.87] Down on the ridge
[01:05.44] But I done blowed up
[01:09.58] The bridge
[01:13.47] Had me a dog
[01:16.88] He was my best friend
[01:20.93] But to him
[01:23.73] I done put an end
[01:28.18] Had me a farm
[01:30.96] Sittin' pretty on the hill
[01:34.62] But if you look
[01:38.57] You'll see it ain't there still
[01:43.12] I don't know why I done it
[01:50.56] Honest, it ain't like me
[01:57.80] But I ain't sad now I done it
[02:05.07] 'Cause a baby boy has got to be free
[02:11.43] 